Lost in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts
Nelson F. Liu1∗
Kevin Lin2
John Hewitt1
Ashwin Paranjape3
Michele Bevilacqua3
Fabio Petroni3
Percy Liang1
1
2
3
Stanford University
